Blood Donor Management CRUD
----------------------------

Develop a Python Console Application to manage a Blood Donor Management System
using OOPs and MySQL.

Database Details:
    Database : blood_db
    Table    : donor

Columns:
    id          : int, primary key, auto increment
    name        : varchar(100)
    blood_group : varchar(5)
    phone       : varchar(15) unique
    city        : varchar(100)
    last_donation : date

Requirements:
    Create a class named BloodDonorManager